  <section class="doc-section">
    <p class="eyebrow">IN PLAIN ENGLISH</p>
    <h2>What is VulnWeave?</h2>
    <p>Security tools are good at detecting specific things: a leaked secret, a vulnerable package, unsafe code, or insecure configuration. The problem is that each tool reports in a different way. A developer can end up with overlapping alerts and no clear starting point.</p>
    <p>VulnWeave runs those tools locally, converts their output into one consistent format, keeps the proof behind each result, and helps you review the outcome. It is not a replacement for security review or for the scanners themselves.</p>
  </section>
  <section class="doc-section">
