    <div class="step-list">
      <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Scan your repository</h3><p>Run Gitleaks, Semgrep, OSV-Scanner, and Trivy from your own computer.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Remove alert noise</h3><p>Overlapping dependency reports are correlated into one issue while preserving each scanner’s evidence.</p></div></article>
      <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Understand impact</h3><p>Use source symbols, static imports, Git changes, owners, and priority signals to focus the review.</p></div></article>
